.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-project-create - Create a project


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro project create [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a project

.PP
At most 50 projects per account (409 \fBproject_limit\fR). Optional \fBservice_ids\fR move services in at once. Writes: 60 per minute per key (429 \fBrate_limited\fR). Sub-account keys cannot create, rename or delete projects (403 \fBsubkey_forbidden\fR). Errors: 422 \fBinvalid_name\fR, \fBname_reserved\fR, \fBinvalid_color\fR, \fBinvalid_icon\fR, \fBinvalid_description\fR, \fBinvalid_service_ids\fR; 409 \fBname_taken\fR; 404 \fBservice_not_found\fR\&.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/projects (operationId createProject, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--color\fP=""
	color (gray|blue|green|red|orange|yellow|purple|pink|teal|indigo)

.PP
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--description\fP=""
	description

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for create

.PP
\fB--icon\fP=""
	icon (folder|briefcase|building|cart3|cloud|code-slash|controller|globe2|heart|house|kanban|lightning|people|rocket-takeoff|shield-lock|shop|star|tools|truck|box-seam|mortarboard|camera)

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--name\fP=""
	Letter or digit first; then letters, digits, space and . _ - / + # & ( ). Unique per account (case-insensitive). Reserved: Genel, General, Default.

.PP
\fB--service-ids\fP=[]
	Optional: move these services into the new project at once

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
